<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/12/eng@/~cl_6__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for the marginal note the following marginal note: \"Inquiry, restoration into register and removal from register by the Board.\";"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/12/eng@/~cl_6__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/12/eng@/~cl_6> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/12/eng@> .
